{"seq":41,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-fix-2026-10b/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory-fix/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-28T12:44:37.921Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"bcd510a69522a1303abb77fc36c4525cb8c0fe980cbb3dfaa0d14fb736b795f3","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Kwame, Pellucid Harbor Logistics officially changed hands on 03.11.2025. Moss's Coastal digest of 02.11.2025 says the account changes hands \"tomorrow\", and Bettina's cutover recap of 08.12.2025 calls 03.11.2025 the official handoff.\n\nThe recap also says Bettina kept running the account day to day until the terminal cutover finished, and that you fully took over on 22.11.2025. Use 03.11.2025 for the official change in the CRM. If the CRM also tracks when you took over day to day, that date is 22.11.2025.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000131"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000132","thread_ts":"1792159200.000131"}}
